1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
When I was a child, I was so poor that each meal was just plain rice with a bit of salt.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:11,000
Every day I had to carry water for people at the market to earn a few coins for food.

3
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:14,000
I came home when everyone else was already asleep.

4
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:19,000
I studied alone under a dim oil lamp, the words blurry and faint.

5
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:22,000
But I never stopped dreaming.

6
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:25,000
Others would say, we haven't even got food.

7
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:27,000
What's the point of studying?

8
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:29,000
I only knew one thing.

9
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:34,000
If I didn't study, my life would forever revolve around that bucket of water.

10
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:36,000
I would never rise above it.

11
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:40,000
Eventually, I scored high enough to get into a top school.

12
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:46,000
When I set foot in the city, looking back at the road I had walked, I didn't feel proud.

13
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:50,000
Because I knew as a child, I wasn't smarter than anyone else.

14
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:52,000
I was just luckier than many.

15
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:54,000
I didn't give up.

16
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:58,000
If you want to climb a high mountain, you must be willing to endure the climb.

17
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:00,000
No one can succeed for you.

